= Experiments
All gates are pre-registered in the ipse repo before data is seen; each cites a commit.

== E0: the self-probe
Train across multiple behaviors and measure which internal components stay stable
versus reorganize @emergent_self, at regular intervals over months. Primary claim.
// Prereg: TBD. Needs the first learned organ; instrument now so it has history.

== E1: prediction error versus dedicated detectors
Catch and false-trip rates for falls, actuator derate and odometry drift on tapes,
against the fall monitor, manual derate detection and tag drift. // Prereg/result: TBD.

== E2: sleep helps the next day
Alternating nights: surprise-prioritized, random, no replay. Measures: next-day
surprise, go-home success, falls. // Prereg/result: TBD; ~2 weeks of robot days.

== E3: inheritance
A fresh body (K1; G1 in sim) boots with the epigenome versus from scratch; time to
equal competence. // Prereg/result: TBD.
